{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given an integer array `nums` that **may contain duplicates**, return all possible subsets. The answer must **not** contain duplicate subsets."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/d6ad99a9-d227-4ce7-98c9-cf985ac1738e.svg",
      "alt": "Subsets of 1, 2, 2, sorted. Each node is a subset, and its children add one later number. At the same level, the second 2 is skipped because it would build exactly what the first 2 already built: the dashed nodes are never explored. The six subsets are {}, 1, 12, 122, 2 and 22.",
